<title>HONG KONG: HK land auction - Chai Wan site fetches HK$11.82 bln.</title>
<headline>HK land auction - Chai Wan site fetches HK$11.82 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 25,592 sq m site in Chai Wan on Hong Kong island, zoned for non-industrial usage, sold for HK$11.82 billion on Tuesday in a drawn out government land auction which lasted for more than two hours.</p>
<p>Industry analysts had forecast the plot would sell for between HK$6.0 billion to $14.8 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6352</p>
</text>
